        Trust the Fucking Agent
      </h1>
      <p class="text-base text-mist mt-6 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">
        Not an argument for vibes-based autonomy. An argument that if an agent is going to do real work, the trust boundary should live in the substrate — not get reenacted in the chat every five minutes.
      </p>
